download yourself from https://developer.clo3d.com/download.html. The SDK's headers,
libraries and samples belong to CLO Virtual Fashion Inc., are governed by CLO's own
terms (https://legal.clo-set.com/additional-clo), and are not covered by this project's
licence. You need your own CLO3D licence to use it.

cpp_plugin/test/pure_stubs.h is generated locally from those headers by gen_stubs.py
and is deliberately not committed.

